{"v":1,"book":"Jer","ch":46,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"The word of Jehovah that came to Jeremiah the prophet concerning the nations:","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" that came to "},{"t":"Jeremiah","s":["H3414"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"prophet","s":["H5030"],"a":[6]},{"t":" concerning the nations:"}]},{"n":2,"text":"Concerning Egypt: Concerning the army of Pharaoh Neco, the king of Egypt, which was by the river Euphrates at Carchemish, which Nebuchadrezzar the king of Babylon struck down in the fourth year of Jehoiakim the son of Josiah, the king of Judah:","tok":[{"t":"Concerning "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[0]},{"t":": Concerning the "},{"t":"army","s":["H2428"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6549"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Neco","s":["H6549"]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[6]},{"t":", which was by the "},{"t":"river","s":["H5104"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Euphrates","s":["H6578"],"a":[11]},{"t":" at "},{"t":"Carchemish","s":["H3751"],"a":[12]},{"t":", which "},{"t":"Nebuchadrezzar","s":["H5019"],"a":[15]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[16]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[17]},{"t":" struck down in the "},{"t":"fourth","s":["H7243"],"a":[19]},{"t":" "},{"t":"year","s":["H8141"],"a":[18]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehoiakim","s":["H3079"],"a":[20]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[21]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Josiah","s":["H2977"],"a":[22]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[23]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[24]},{"t":":"}]},{"n":3,"text":"Prepare the buckler and shield, And draw near to battle.","tok":[{"t":"Prepare","s":["H6186"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"buckler","s":["H4043"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"shield","s":["H6793"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And draw "},{"t":"near","s":["H5066"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"battle","s":["H4421"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Harness the horses, And mount the steeds; And take your stand with helmets on; Polish the spears; Put on the armor.","tok":[{"t":"Harness","s":["H0631"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"horses","s":["H5483"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And mount the steeds; And take your stand with "},{"t":"helmets","s":["H3553"],"a":[5]},{"t":" on; "},{"t":"Polish","s":["H4838"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"spears","s":["H7420"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; Put "},{"t":"on","s":["H3847"],"a":[8]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"armor","s":["H5630"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Why have I seen it? They are dismayed; They are turning backward; And their mighty men are crushed and flee in hasty flight, And they do not look back; terror is on every side, Declares Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"Why have I "},{"t":"seen","s":["H7200"],"a":[1]},{"t":" it? They are "},{"t":"dismayed","s":["H2844"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; They are "},{"t":"turning","s":["H5472"],"a":[4]},{"t":" backward; And their mighty men are crushed and flee in hasty flight, And they do not look "},{"t":"back","s":["H6437"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; terror is on every side, Declares "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Let not the swift one flee away And the mighty man escape; In the north by the river Euphrates They have stumbled and fallen.","tok":[{"t":"Let not the "},{"t":"swift","s":["H7031"],"a":[2]},{"t":" one flee "},{"t":"away","s":["H5127"],"a":[1]},{"t":" And the mighty "},{"t":"man","s":["H1368"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"escape","s":["H4422"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; In the "},{"t":"north","s":["H6828"],"a":[6]},{"t":" by the "},{"t":"river","s":["H5104"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Euphrates","s":["H6578"],"a":[10]},{"t":" They have "},{"t":"stumbled","s":["H3782"],"a":[11]},{"t":" and fallen."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Who is this who rises up like the Nile, Like rivers whose waters surge?","tok":[{"t":"Who is this who rises "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[3]},{"t":" like the Nile, Like "},{"t":"rivers","s":["H5104"],"a":[4]},{"t":" whose "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[6]},{"t":" surge?"}]},{"n":8,"text":"Egypt rises up like the Nile, Even like rivers whose waters surge. And he says, I will rise up and will cover the land; I will destroy the city and the inhabitants in it.","tok":[{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[0]},{"t":" rises "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[2]},{"t":" like the Nile, Even like "},{"t":"rivers","s":["H5104"],"a":[3]},{"t":" whose "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[5]},{"t":" surge. And he "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[6]},{"t":", I will rise "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and will "},{"t":"cover","s":["H3680"],"a":[8]},{"t":" the land; I will "},{"t":"destroy","s":["H0006"],"a":[10]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[11]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"inhabitants","s":["H3427"],"a":[12]},{"t":" in it."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Go up, O horses, And drive furiously, O chariots; And let the mighty men go forth: Cush and Put, who handle the shield, And the Ludim, who handle and bend the bow.","tok":[{"t":"Go "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[0]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"horses","s":["H5483"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And drive furiously, O "},{"t":"chariots","s":["H7393"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; And let the mighty "},{"t":"men","s":["H1368"],"a":[5]},{"t":" go "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3318"],"a":[4]},{"t":": Cush and Put, who "},{"t":"handle","s":["H8610"],"a":[8]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"shield","s":["H4043"],"a":[9]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"Ludim","s":["H3866"],"a":[10]},{"t":", who "},{"t":"handle","s":["H8610"],"a":[11]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"bend","s":["H1869"],"a":[12]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"bow","s":["H7198"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"For this day belongs to the Lord Jehovah of hosts, A day of vengeance to avenge Himself on His adversaries; And the sword will devour and be satisfied, And it will drink its fill of their blood; For there is a sacrifice to the Lord Jehovah of hosts In the land of the north by the river Euphrates.","tok":[{"t":"For this "},{"t":"day","s":[